<title>UK: LucasVarity to sell stake in battery firm.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity to sell stake in battery firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-U.S. engineering group LucasVarity said on Wednesday that it had agreed to sell its 50 percent stake in its battery firm Lucas Yuasa to its partner, Yuasa Corporation of Japan, for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>LucasVarity said that as part of the agreement it would continue to distribute Lucas branded batteries on an exclusive basis to the European aftermarket.</p>
</text>
